      "text": "(Optional)\nUser may request Deep Research for more information (more costly - higher capped\namount):  \n• Industry & business model\n• Geographic footprint\n• Employee count\n• Funding & financials\n• Hiring trends\n• Direct travel indicators (business / local / unclear)\n• Recent expansion\n• Support complexity\nReuses what's already known; looks for stronger sources",
